Hi all,
Open Source Firmware community has come a long way since its debut: and
truly appreciating the freedom fighters and firmware enthusiasts from the
U-Boot community that work tirelessly to promote Open Source Firmware, our
journey was never easy.

This time, we hereby want to invite you to Open Source Firmware Foundation
Firmware Hackathon - to Bochum, Germany, to gather all the firmware folks
together for a good technical sharing and have fun hacking firmware as a
community.

There will be free flow of drinks and a dinner party comes with the ticket,
for more info, refer to the posters attached or here:
https://opensourcefirmware.foundation/events/osff-fall-hackathon-2023/

Happy to see you there!!!

Best Regards,
